# Maintainer: Yūrei Linux project
# Yūrei's own recipe (stage 3, the desktop; docs/INDEPENDENT.md). The source
# address and sum are the ones in independent/bootstrap/sources.lock;
# check-recipes.py keeps them the same.
pkgname=xtrans
pkgver=1.5.2
pkgrel=1
pkgdesc="X11 network transport code, used by the X libraries"
arch=(any)
url="https://www.x.org/"
license=(MIT)
source=("https://www.x.org/releases/individual/lib/xtrans-$pkgver.tar.xz")
sha256sums=('5c5cbfe34764a9131d048f03c31c19e57fb4c682d67713eab6a65541b4dff86c')

build() {
    cd xtrans-$pkgver
    ./configure --prefix=/usr --sysconfdir=/etc --localstatedir=/var --disable-static \
        --disable-docs
    make
}

package() {
    cd xtrans-$pkgver
    make DESTDIR="$pkgdir" install
}
